{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/228799-the-frankenstein-theory","id":228799,"title":"The Frankenstein Theory","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-08-14T22:41:54-07:00","id":228799,"title":"The Frankenstein Theory","content":"Anyone caught this one on netfix? Not too shabby for a low budget netflix horror. Which brings ne to my question, anyone gotten any inspiration for a prommy character or chronicle from it? Truthfully, out of my group of 6, im the only one who has read the book, and I cant understand why, or why the forum isnt abuzz with chatter about it...its a pretty fantastic gameline!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=392\" data-tempid=\"temp_392_1519878565794_106\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3676-manbearpig","name":"ManBearPig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3676_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"148"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-15T05:36:56-07:00","id":229000,"title":"","content":"You need to play it in order to understand why each and every mechanic of the game is shambling at best. It's a great game on paper, but when played you quickly understand that you need to houserule just about everything, and at that point it starts being less and less of a great game.<br /> <br /> Don't get me wrong, it's my favorite gameline, the flavor is awesome, the kinds of games we've played with P:tC were all exciting and philosophical, but it has to get a Chronicle book in order to live up to its full potential.<br /> <br /> As for the movie, haven't seen it but I just may! Last thing: don't play a Promethean game with 5 other people. Promethean is a very personal and intense game of character development and character study. 5 players is a little too much. I did a 4 and a 3, and the fewer players the better.<br /> <br /> Have fun!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Useless-Post Prana<br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Cost: 2</span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">m; </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mins: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Linguistics 1, Essence 1 </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Type: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Simple</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Keywords: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mute</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Duration: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Instant</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Prerequisite Charms: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Ten-Characters Methodology</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2589-magnum-opus","name":"Magnum Opus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2589_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"821"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-17T21:04:10-07:00","id":232373,"title":"","content":"You'll note that my signature contains extensive Promethean houseruling. This is for a reason.<br /> Magnum Opus and I were working on updating Transmutations together, but he got busy and I got - well, I don't drink, so whatever the &quot;I can't deal with this shit&quot; equivalent is for a sober person.<br /> I guess too much Path of Exile?<br /> <br /> Lovely game, amazing themes, early nWoD mechanics are a headache, etc etc.<br /> <br /> I haven't seen the movie. &quot;May&quot; is what screams Promethean to me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1S8EuNtxeJKwq4sKVVPe16_N0ylIashKpgfCCuA1UOM8/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Promethean Homebrew.</a><br /> <br /> Yes, I made it the same way as a Promethean. No, the authorities haven't found me yet.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/685-ben-quo","name":"Ben Quo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar685_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"195"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}